+Files are named `01-ABCDEF.pdf`, `02-123456.pdf`, and so on. Each file includes
+only its own exact reference or, for glass templates, its group of four, six or
+eight references. No individual fragment contains a whole-collection QR or other
+fragments’ references. All cards are rendered before the finished directory is published.
+This is **not Shamir secret sharing**: every reference is needed to recover the
+mnemonic; the individual cards reveal portions of the encoded representation.
